    <item>
      <title>债券反弹减轻了在贸易动荡一周中昏昏欲睡的市场</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/bond-market-rebound-relieves-markets-dazed-by-trade-war-turmoil</link>
      <description><![CDATA[周一，华尔街终于在唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）释放他的全球贸易战以来就从市场上竞争的深厚抛售和异常锋利的波动引起了人们的喘息。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/bond-market-rebound-relieves-markets-dazed-by-trade-war-turmoil</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 20:09:10 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>巴西提供石油块的石油块</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/brazil-to-offer-oil-blocks-where-petrobras-is-fighting-to-drill</link>
      <description><![CDATA[巴西石油监管机构将在一个有希望的海上地区授予勘探权，在该地区，国家控制的石油生产商Petrobras已与环境当局面临长达一年的纠纷，以开始钻探。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/brazil-to-offer-oil-blocks-where-petrobras-is-fighting-to-drill</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 19:54:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>阿根廷的比索幻灯片，债券在FX规则升起后跳跃</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/argentina-assets-surge-after-lifting-fx-controls-amid-imf-deal</link>
      <description><![CDATA[阿根廷的主权债务攀升了，而比索在该国取消了其大部分货币市场限制之后，作为其新的200亿美元计划与国际货币基金组织的新计划的一部分。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/argentina-assets-surge-after-lifting-fx-controls-amid-imf-deal</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 12:07:35 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票和债券爬上一周的动荡：市场包裹</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一定程度的平静返回华尔街，在唐纳德·特朗普总统的颠覆性贸易战的束缚中，股票和债券在动荡不安的一周后赢得了双胞胎集会。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-13/us-futures-rise-after-trump-pauses-tech-tariffs-markets-wrap</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 22:40:41 GMT</pubDate>
